    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >--- \u200b<strong>\u200bRoguelike Mode, Now Available!\u200b</strong>\u200b ---</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ancient monsters are invading the castle\u2014join the fight and defend against the dragon\u2019s assault!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Mix and match equipment for diverse combat styles!<br>\u2022 Summon divine guardians to fight by your side!<br>\u2022 Unlock 20+ new achievements\u2014take on the challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505060/extras/a7200c765b672b5d62f008a494543d26.avif?t=1753154782\" data-has-big width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>--- \u200b\u200bIdentity Deduction Mode\u200b\u200b ---</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Castle of Mist&quot; draws inspiration from social deduction games like Werewolf, featuring first-person immersive castle exploration. Players engage in psychological battles within the mysterious castle, influencing the game's outcome by searching for items and triggering hidden events. With suspenseful execution phases and multiple random events, each round delivers a uniquely thrilling experience!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Identity Deduction \u00d7 Multiplayer Online \u00d7 Intense Social Deception  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travelers from around the world have stumbled into a rift in time and space, trapped in an abandoned castle haunted by malevolent spirits and their curses. To escape, they must break the curse\u2014but dark forces lurk in the shadows. Will they work together to survive, or betray each other for victory?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  Faction Warfare: A Battle of Lies and Truth  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Randomly assigned as Righteous or Hidden Evil, compete for victory through tasks, votes, and sabotage.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 The Righteous must restore energy and complete tasks, while the Evil sabotage in secret\u2014even disguising themselves as allies!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >High-Stakes Exploration: Strategy Decides Survival  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Scavenge for parts, fight for special items (like runestones to disrupt votes), or hunt for the Contract\u2014a deadly chance to win alone!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Energy towers, crosses, broken components\u2026 Every choice could turn the tide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Psychological Warfare: Who Will Outlast the Rest?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Vote, debate, frame\u2014use words and acting to earn trust\u2026 or orchestrate a fatal betrayal.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 If half the tasks fail, the Evil unleash a massacre! The Righteous must expose the traitors, or face total annihilation.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Cooperate? Or betray?\u2014The last one standing isn\u2019t always the winner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505060/extras/2fd777d6a267ada09d197068f4dbb8bc.poster.avif?t=1753154782\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505060/extras/2fd777d6a267ada09d197068f4dbb8bc.webm?t=1753154782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505060/extras/2fd777d6a267ada09d197068f4dbb8bc.mp4?t=1753154782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505060/extras/0541c82e0c089e708d2048d2e593c100.poster.avif?t=1753154782\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505060/extras/0541c82e0c089e708d2048d2e593c100.webm?t=1753154782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505060/extras/0541c82e0c089e708d2048d2e593c100.mp4?t=1753154782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505060/extras/94c03884dd078e88716190ec85f33763.poster.avif?t=1753154782\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505060/extras/94c03884dd078e88716190ec85f33763.webm?t=1753154782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505060/extras/94c03884dd078e88716190ec85f33763.mp4?t=1753154782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505060/extras/4b488f75e1d49611d120d52e5bb0c171.poster.avif?t=1753154782\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505060/extras/4b488f75e1d49611d120d52e5bb0c171.webm?t=1753154782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505060/extras/4b488f75e1d49611d120d52e5bb0c171.mp4?t=1753154782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505060/extras/0c00a14b007b69cb9c09599f0b23b3ed.poster.avif?t=1753154782\" widt